WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
Cornac Workbench
A sequential and a generative SID recommender on one purchase history

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:09.066
One user's purchase history from Amazon Beauty.
Which item did they buy next?

3
00:00:09.066 --> 00:00:13.016
They bought a fine-liner brush.

4
00:00:13.016 --> 00:00:20.466
A sequential model scores every item.
A generative SID model generates Semantic IDs (SIDs).

5
00:00:20.466 --> 00:00:24.932
LETTER ranks the brush #1. SASRec does not list it.

6
00:00:24.932 --> 00:00:29.749
But 1,643 items share LETTER's SID.

7
00:00:29.749 --> 00:00:37.099
A resolver picks the item:
most similar gives the brush, most popular a sunscreen.

8
00:00:37.099 --> 00:00:47.032
Two items with the same SID give LETTER the same input
and the same five SIDs. SASRec's two lists share none.

9
00:00:47.032 --> 00:00:54.648
Cornac scores SID models at three levels.
LETTER, Recall@5: SID 0.196, item 0.017, CCE 0.004.

10
00:00:54.648 --> 00:01:00.041
Try the demo!
cornac-workbench.preferred.ai
pip install cornac
